  1. Polyphenol Supplementation: Benefits for Exercise Performance or Oxidative Stress?
     Kathryn H. Myburgh
     PMC4008802 · PMC · 2014-05-03
     https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4008802/
     "This review examines polyphenol supplementation's effects on exercise performance and oxidative stress. Current evidence is insufficient to recommend polyphenol use for athletes due to study limitations."

